  <name>HTS Time</name>
  <summary>Human Time System (HTS) Universal Tool</summary>

  <description>
    <p>
      The Storcke Human Time System is a foundational technology designed for the One Millionth Century.
      It provides a cyclical, infinite calendar starting from A0.
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>Live UTC HTS Clock display</li>
      <li>Bi-directional Gregorian to HTS conversion</li>
      <li>Relative future and past time lookups</li>
      <li>Multiple high-contrast themes (Dark, Light, Sepia, Neon)</li>
    </ul>
  </description>

